          "explanation": "The doctor provided a low-burden bedside checklist for rounds.",
          "quote": "你现在手里这五条"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO3 was triggered by caregiver fatigue, scattered records, and transition complexity. The doctor repeatedly gave low-burden, real-world steps such as written discharge instructions, bedside questions, and not relying on memory.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
