          "quote": "血糖仪显示大概 **3.8 mmol/L**"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_02147",
          "explanation": "The doctor non-ambiguously repaired the chain by directing emergency escalation and no oral feeding.",
          "quote": "直接 120"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO4 was triggered when the family reported persistent low glucose with impaired swallowing and lethargy. The doctor gave a clear, non-blaming repair path to emergency care and reinforced no feeding or self-medication.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
